## Summary

The Vibe Coding view has **3 resizable panels**:

| Panel | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Chat** (left 30%) | Conversation with AI — uses existing `Chat` component in `vibe` mode |
| **Changes** (center 25%) | Git diff viewer — file list with `+/-` stats & inline diff |
| **Preview** (right, grows) | `AppWindow` iframe embedding the project's VNC/workspace app |

**Key features:**
- Toggle each panel independently via the status bar buttons
- Auto-selects VNC app from project workspaces
- Polls `changesSummary` API for real-time diff display
- Session picker for switching between vibe chat sessions
- Branch + project name shown in the status bar

